PLACEHOLDER ONLY — do not put a real API key in this file.

Create ./secrets/anthropic-api-key (no extension) — that path is
gitignored and must never be committed, see CLAUDE.md's secrets rule.
Unlike this file, it must contain ONLY the raw key value and nothing
else (no comments, no surrounding text) — the agent reads the whole
file content as the key:

sk-ant-REPLACE_ME
